6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet? Idate hasn't come, yet?</font>

26
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My lord, we finally found evidence</font>

27
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">regarding the matter
we were investigating.</font>

28
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see.</font>

29
00:01:58,180 --> 00:02:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mm, good work.</font>

30
00:02:01,930 --> 00:02:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My lord, is there something amiss?</font>

31
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's nothing.</font>

32
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate on my Chakra.</font>

33
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're saved.</font>

34
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, are you okay?</font>

35
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I'm counting on you.</font>

36
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protect Idate.</font>

37
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">You Can Reach It</font>

38
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"> Idate!</font>

39
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Last Spring</font>

40
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of Determination!!</font>

41
00:03:12,210 --> 00:03:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Poison needles won't work on me.</font>

42
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you do that
to Sasuke and Sakura?!</font>

43
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest easy.</font>

44
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll send you to the place
where they are real soon.</font>

45
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't go so easily!</font>

46
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

47
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what do I do?</font>

48
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Rasengan
won't work on his sword.</font>

49
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter.</font>

50
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:46,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two are waiting for my help!</font>

51
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Saving each other again, huh?!</font>

52
00:03:49,830 --> 00:03:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They wouldn't survive
falling off this cliff.</font>

53
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

54
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

55
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... you're going to run away
from here using such a diversion?</font>

56
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me!
Who's going to run away?</font>

57
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, it's futile.
That technique won't work on that sword!</font>

58
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile!</font>

59
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

60
00:04:51,810 --> 00:04:54,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like the Uchiha loser earlier,</font>

61
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why is it that each and every
Leaf Village Ninja is an idiot?</font>

62
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

63
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to save those two!</font>

64
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you seriously thinking
they're alive after falling off this cliff?</font>

65
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've gotten out of here.</font>

66
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As if...</font>

67
00:05:14,370 --> 00:05:18,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd abandon my comrades
and run away!</font>

68
00:05:19,130 --> 00:05:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my answer to the tenth problem!</font>

69
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:25,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?</font>

70
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more time.</font>

71
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this.</font>

72
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot.</font>

73
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:35,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

74
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

75
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still don't get it?!
You don't have a chance of winning!</font>

76
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

77
00:06:12,970 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

78
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the damage Sasuke inflicted.</font>

79
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

80
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:25,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I aim for that...</font>

81
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can win!</font>

82
00:06:28,450 --> 00:06:32,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saying you still want to fight?
Give it up, already!</font>

83
00:06:32,410 --> 00:06:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

84
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

85
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke gave me a chance!
I won't waste it!</font>

86
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

87
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay still!</font>

88
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! They're using
the Water Clone Jutsu!</font>

89
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

90
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trust us, Idate!
We'll protect you, no matter what!</font>

91
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura...</font>

92
00:07:09,490 --> 00:07:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go on ahead.
We'll be right behind you.</font>

93
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

94
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

95
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate people who don't know
when to quit.</font>

96
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end.</font>

97
00:07:37,930 --> 00:07:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A foolish cheap trick.</font>

98
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

99
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:51,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying I can't stand this
saving each other business.</font>

100
00:07:51,860 --> 00:07:53,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

101
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is over here!</font>

102
00:07:59,000 --> 00:07:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Above!</font>

103
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

104
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

105
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:24,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

106
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you did it!</font>

107
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

108
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really something.</font>

109
00:08:49,170 --> 00:08:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, well...</font>

110
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:51,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

111
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...! Idate...!</font>

112
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:01,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

113
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's okay?</font>

114
00:09:04,060 --> 00:09:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's okay, too.</font>

115
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:09,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm coming to save you now.</font>

116
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot. Forget about us and
get going to the finish line, quick!</font>

117
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.</font>

118
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what should we do about this?</font>

119
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

120
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll cut the rope and go
to the opposite bank in one swing!</font>

121
00:09:29,460 --> 00:09:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it!</font>

122
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought the worst of myself.</font>

123
00:09:39,050 --> 00:09:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Boss Jirocho trusted in me.</font>

124
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I trust you more than anyone.</font>

125
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:52,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the first time
I was trusted by someone.</font>

126
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I wanted to win this race
for the boss, no matter what.</font>

127
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in reality, I can't win
just with such feelings.</font>

128
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So many times along the way,
I felt like giving up.</font>

129
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch out!</font>

130
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But each time,</font>

131
00:10:07,460 --> 00:10:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you guys risked your lives
to save a lame duck like me!</font>

132
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I'm sorry.</font>

133
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should've trusted you guys
from the start.</font>

134
00:10:21,470 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?</font>

135
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say stuff like that
after winning the race.</font>

136
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

137
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

138
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

139
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, do it!</font>

140
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:46,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

141
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boo! Boo! Boo!</font>

142
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that's a rousing welcome.</font>

143
00:11:24,330 --> 00:11:27,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, at this rate,
we'll crash into the rocks!</font>

144
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. Leave it to me!</font>

145
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release Chakra from
the bottom of my feet.</font>

146
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the very last Chakra!</font>

147
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then stick to
the rocks with Chakra!</font>

148
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, Naruto!</font>

149
00:11:49,930 --> 00:11:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now dash to the finish line!</font>

150
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, I'll come back
to help you right away!</font>

151
00:11:58,070 --> 00:11:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Let's go, Idate.</font>

152
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

153
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run steady, Fukusuke!</font>

154
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay sharp until the end.</font>

155
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I know.</font>

156
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Geez... spoiling my good mood.</font>

157
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see the Todoroki Great Shrine.</font>

158
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss!</font>

159
00:12:31,430 --> 00:12:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast it!</font>

160
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good, good.</font>

161
00:12:40,650 --> 00:12:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate.</font>

162
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey!
— Oh!</font>

163
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's that?</font>

164
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here he comes!</font>

165
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:49,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate of the Wasabi Family is here!</font>

166
00:12:54,370 --> 00:12:55,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

167
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can still catch up!</font>

168
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

169
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

170
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

171
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Fukusuke?! Run!</font>

172
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

173
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose.</font>

174
00:13:18,770 --> 00:13:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not lose!</font>

175
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't give up until the very end!</font>

176
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like heck. I won't be passed up
after I've come this far!</font>

177
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right!
— He caught up.</font>

178
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast this guy...!</font>

179
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose, you little...!</font>

180
00:13:54,310 --> 00:13:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast...</font>

181
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...!</font>

182
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, Idate!</font>

183
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss!</font>

184
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Idate...!</font>

185
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:18,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

186
00:14:59,620 --> 00:15:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

187
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate.</font>

188
00:15:12,430 --> 00:15:14,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You ran a fine race.</font>

189
00:15:15,350 --> 00:15:16,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss!</font>

190
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:18,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did well.</font>

191
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss, I'm sorry. I'm truly sorry.</font>

192
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool. What're you apologizing for?</font>

193
00:15:26,610 --> 00:15:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won.</font>

194
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, please let me speak.</font>

195
00:15:30,650 --> 00:15:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really want to apologize now.
I'm truly sorry!</font>

196
00:15:35,580 --> 00:15:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're making no sense to me.
What a totally weird guy.</font>

197
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:41,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done, Idate.</font>

198
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was wrong about you.</font>

199
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Idate.
Go receive the winner's blessing.</font>

200
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

201
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Idate!</font>

202
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you idiot!</font>

203
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bringing shame upon the boss!
You're prepared, aren't you?</font>

204
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry!</font>

205
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner!</font>

206
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate Morino of the Wasabi Family!</font>

207
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He finally did it.</font>

208
00:16:30,010 --> 00:16:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey... Just a minute.</font>

209
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kyuroku.</font>

210
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Along the way, he rode
on the back of a hired Ninja.</font>

211
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a violation.</font>

212
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

213
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's proof.</font>

214
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at this photo.</font>

215
00:16:50,690 --> 00:16:55,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Racing until the end on your own strength
is the rule of this race.</font>

216
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, Idate is disqualified.</font>

217
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner is Fukusuke Hikyakuya
of the Wagarashi Family.</font>

218
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

219
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hold it. That was...!</font>

220
00:17:08,670 --> 00:17:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll hear no excuses!
Jirocho, it's a promise.</font>

221
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:16,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I order the Wasabi Family
dissolved immediately.</font>

222
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a minute.</font>

223
00:17:19,970 --> 00:17:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no such rule anywhere.
Do not speak nonsense!</font>

224
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My lord!</font>

225
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or perhaps...</font>

226
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have a reason for wanting
the Wagarashi to win at all cost?</font>

227
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, nothing like that.</font>

228
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be because you would
not be able to do things like this?</font>

229
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look.</font>

230
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool!
Retire and enter the monastery!</font>

231
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes, my lord!</font>

232
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kyuroku Wagarashi.</font>

233
00:17:50,750 --> 00:17:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes?</font>

234
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Word of your evil deeds
has reached my ears as well.</font>

235
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your sins against the people
of Degarashi Port are severe.</font>

236
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, the Wagarashi Family
is to be dissolved as of today.</font>

237
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood?</font>

238
00:18:05,890 --> 00:18:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes, sire.</font>

239
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today is an auspicious day.</font>

240
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, the matter is settled.</font>

241
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for the help, Naruto.</font>

242
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate, this is good-bye, huh?</font>

243
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've come to get the wounded.</font>

244
00:18:31,210 --> 00:18:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ibiki.</font>

245
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Big Brother!</font>

246
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:35,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are the wounded?</font>

247
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:38,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here.</font>

248
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, get him on the boat, quickly.</font>

249
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right.</font>

250
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um, excuse me.</font>

251
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

252
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Nothing.</font>

253
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother!</font>

254
00:18:56,650 --> 00:18:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Big Brother!</font>

255
00:19:00,570 --> 00:19:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?</font>

256
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man who called me
Big Brother died three years ago.</font>

257
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother... I figured out
the answer to the tenth problem!</font>

258
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never betray a comrade again!</font>

259
00:19:24,970 --> 00:19:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can trust others now!</font>

260
00:19:35,770 --> 00:19:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's looking good now.</font>

261
00:19:47,410 --> 00:19:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Bye, Idate. Let's meet again.</font>

262
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good-bye. See you around.</font>

263
00:19:52,250 --> 00:19:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. You guys come again, too, okay?</font>

264
00:19:55,670 --> 00:19:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish you good health, Boss!</font>

265
00:19:57,710 --> 00:19:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

266
00:20:00,470 --> 00:20:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya!</font>

267
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care!</font>

268
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An interesting guy as always.</font>

269
00:20:08,970 --> 00:20:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder the Fifth Hokage
sees potential in him.</font>

270
00:20:13,230 --> 00:20:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Thanks!</font>

271
00:20:17,070 --> 00:20:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate! Next time,
it'll be a battle with me.</font>

272
00:20:24,990 --> 00:20:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, does it hurt?</font>

273
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

274
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness.</font>

275
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those wounds will heal immediately
once we get back to the village.</font>

276
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

277
00:20:35,750 --> 00:20:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rumors were true.</font>

278
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The survivor of
the village's honourable Uchiha Clan...</font>

279
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is just a good-for-nothing kid...</font>

280
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:46,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't beat him!</font>

281
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet, he...</font>

282
00:20:51,730 --> 00:20:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Naruto...!</font>

283
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>GET UP aa sumimasen</b></font></font></font>

284
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>get up! oh, I'm sorry</b></font></font></font>

285
00:21:14,530 --> 00:21:21,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>goku tama ni boku tama ni</b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:14,530 --> 00:21:21,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b>once in a long while, once in a while</b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>yume ni yabureru hito no kakera ga</b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b>the remnants of a person broken by dreams</b></font></font></font>

289
