<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f0d6a3"><b>yama no you ni mieru</b></font></font></font>

292
00:21:29,380 --> 00:21:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#80e9eb"><b>Iook like a mountain</b></font></font></font>

293
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#f0d6a3"><b>kamisama ni hotokesama ni</b></font></font></font>

294
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#80e9eb"><b>clinging to God, clinging to Buddha</b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#a8efa3"><b>sugari naiteru hito no kakera ga</b></font></font></font>

296
