<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#a8efa3"><b>yama no you ni mieru</b></font></font></font>

298
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:52,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#9577e8"><b>Iook like a mountain</b></font></font></font>

299
